{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digging Together: Demo</strong> is the beginning of a chaotic digging adventure that starts with friendship and turns into rivalry. Maybe you\u2019ll claim the greatest treasure\u2026 but not in the demo! <br><br>Are you ready to dig side by side with your friends? <br><br><strong>Dig, Progress, Survive!</strong> <br>Be a Digger, Carrier, Scanner, or Energy Master \u2013 whichever you choose, teamwork is essential! Cooperate to survive in an underground world full of falling rocks, exploding dynamite, and unexpected surprises.<br><br> The demo includes only limited content; make do with what you have, use your wits and reflexes.<br><br> The full version will bring much more: larger maps, puzzles, dungeons, a competitive Treasure Hunt mode, more classes, and even greater chaos! <br><br>Together or Rivals? The demo offers about 30 minutes of co-op fun. If you\u2019re ready for true digging battles and treasure rivalry\u2026 the full release is waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057650?t=1759868340","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4057650?t=1759868340","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057650/641fd380d2ab575336d4b65fe405d55d8cdaec4c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759868340","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057650/641fd380d2ab575336d4b65fe405d55d8cdaec4c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759868340","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Digging Together: Demo</strong> is the beginning of a chaotic digging adventure that starts with friendship and turns into rivalry. Maybe you\u2019ll claim the greatest treasure\u2026 but not in the demo! <br><br>Are you ready to dig side by side with your friends? <br><br><strong>Dig, Progress, Survive!</strong> <br>Be a Digger, Carrier, Scanner, or Energy Master \u2013 whichever you choose, teamwork is essential! Cooperate to survive in an underground world full of falling rocks, exploding dynamite, and unexpected surprises.<br><br> The demo includes only limited content; make do with what you have, use your wits and reflexes.<br><br> The full version will bring much more: larger maps, puzzles, dungeons, a competitive Treasure Hunt mode, more classes, and even greater chaos! <br><br>Together or Rivals? The demo offers about 30 minutes of co-op fun. If you\u2019re ready for true digging battles and treasure rivalry\u2026 the full release is waiting!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Suber Game Studio ","Cem Bal"],"fullgame":{"appid":"3938040","name":"Digging Together"},"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4057650/081e366e86da2ddc5b94c09423c623a4a53643e2/header.jpg?t=1759868340","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057650/1267293734/2f066cac3056c93279d718b1e9828886ef932a59/1758728430/dash_av1.mpd?t=1759338838","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4057650/1267293734/2f066cac3056c93279d718b1e9828886ef932a59/1758728430/dash_h264.mpd?t=1759338838","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstat